<!--
  Strings for the Phase 3 player menus + song edit sheets (ui/mochy/player/menu
  + ui/mochy/menu/songedit). Values copied verbatim from Mochy's res, except
  brand mentions: "Mochy" -> "ChordWave" in user-visible text (song_edit_video_auto,
  video_pick_auto). Only strings actually referenced by the staged files are
  included; deliberately NOT included:
    - share, start_radio: already in the worktree (values/strings.xml).
    - skin_customise_title, video_find, video_wrong: staged by sibling
      Phase 3 chunks (phase3-player-styles, phase3-player-video) with
      identical Mochy values; duplicate names would break the build.
      See NEEDS.md §(a) A5 — this chunk depends on those chunks merging.
    - tv_menu_*: DeviceMenuRows is a no-op stub (remote devices out of scope).
    - cast_connecting: the cast section of DeviceOutputSheet is dropped.
    - skin_customise_body: the sheet shows its empty state only (no module system).
    - song_edit_add_to_library / song_edit_need_library / song_edit_not_now:
      the "add to library first" gate is dropped with the db (NEEDS.md E1).
  All names were checked against the worktree res + other staging res dirs:
  no remaining collisions at staging time (15 Nov 2026).
-->
